sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as ODH Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant KServeWH as KServe Webhooks
    participant KServeCtrl as KServe Controller
    participant OdhMC as odh-model-controller
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant / Authorino
    participant vLLM as vLLM Model Server
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway
    participant KubeAuth as kube-auth-proxy
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 1: Model Deployment via Dashboard

    User->>Gateway: Navigate to Dashboard (HTTPS 443)
    Gateway->>KubeAuth: ext_authz check (fail-closed)
    KubeAuth-->>Gateway: OAuth2 token validated
    Gateway->>Dashboard: Forward with x-forwarded-access-token
    Dashboard-->>User: Show model serving UI

    User->>Dashboard: Create InferenceService
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Proxy K8s API call<br/>(user token impersonation)
    K8sAPI->>KServeWH: Admission webhooks fire
    KServeWH-->>K8sAPI: Defaults + validation applied
    K8sAPI-->>Dashboard: InferenceService created

    KServeCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService
    KServeCtrl->>KServeCtrl: Select ClusterServingRuntime<br/>(e.g., vLLM CUDA)
    KServeCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service, HPA

    OdhMC->>K8sAPI: Watch InferenceService
    OdhMC->>K8sAPI: Create Route, NetworkPolicy,<br/>RBAC, ServiceMonitor
    OdhMC->>Kuadrant: Create AuthPolicy for<br/>LLMInferenceService

    vLLM->>S3: Download model artifacts<br/>(AWS IAM auth)
    Note over vLLM: Model loaded into GPU memory
    vLLM-->>KServeCtrl: Pod ready

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v2/models/my-model/infer<br/>(HTTPS, TLS 1.2+)
    Gateway->>KubeAuth: ext_authz validation
    KubeAuth-->>Gateway: Token validated
    Gateway->>vLLM: Route to InferenceService<br/>(HTTPRoute match)
    vLLM-->>Gateway: Inference result
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON response (HTTPS)

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 2: MaaS Multi-Tenant Model Access

    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant MaaSCtrl as maas-controller
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api (per-tenant)
    participant Praxis as praxis-extproc
    participant MaaSGW as maas-default-gateway
    participant Authorino as Authorino
    participant Limitador as Limitador
    participant APIClient as API Consumer

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create AITenant CR
    K8sAPI->>MaaSCtrl: Reconcile AITenant
    MaaSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create tenant namespace
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSAPI: Deploy per-tenant maas-api
    MaaSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoutes against maas-default-gateway
    MaaSCtrl->>Kuadrant: Create AuthPolicy + RateLimitPolicy

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create MaaSSubscription
    MaaSCtrl->>Limitador: Configure per-subscription rate limits
    MaaSCtrl->>MaaSAPI: Link API key to model endpoint

    APIClient->>MaaSGW: Inference request<br/>Authorization: Bearer sk-oai-*
    MaaSGW->>Praxis: Pre-auth ExtProc
    Note over Praxis: Extract model ID from body,<br/>set X-Gateway-Model-Name header
    Praxis-->>MaaSGW: Routing header set

    MaaSGW->>Authorino: AuthPolicy evaluation
    Authorino->>MaaSAPI: Validate API key<br/>GET /v1/api-keys/validate
    MaaSAPI-->>Authorino: Key valid, subscription info
    Note over Authorino: Strip Authorization header,<br/>inject X-MaaS-Username,<br/>X-MaaS-Group, X-MaaS-Subscription
    Authorino->>Limitador: Check rate limit
    Limitador-->>Authorino: Within limits
    Authorino-->>MaaSGW: Identity headers injected

    MaaSGW->>Praxis: Post-auth ExtProc
    Note over Praxis: Guardrails + usage metering +<br/>response transformation
    Praxis-->>MaaSGW: Processed

    MaaSGW->>vLLM: Route to KServe backend
    vLLM-->>MaaSGW: Inference response (streaming)
    MaaSGW-->>APIClient: JSON response

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 3: ML Pipeline Execution

    participant DataSci as Data Scientist
    participant DSPUI as Dashboard / KFP SDK
    participant DSPOp as data-science-pipelines
    participant Argo as Argo Workflows
    participant StepPod as Pipeline Step Pod
    participant MLflow as MLflow
    participant KubeRayCluster as KubeRay Cluster

    DataSci->>DSPUI: Submit pipeline definition
    DSPUI->>DSPOp: Create pipeline run<br/>(ml-pipeline API)
    DSPOp->>DSPOp: Store pipeline definition
    DSPOp->>Argo: Create Argo Workflow

    Argo->>StepPod: Schedule step 1: Data preparation
    StepPod->>S3: Download training data
    StepPod-->>Argo: Step complete

    Argo->>StepPod: Schedule step 2: Distributed training
    StepPod->>KubeRayCluster: Create RayCluster
    Note over KubeRayCluster: Distributed training across workers
    KubeRayCluster-->>StepPod: Training complete
    StepPod->>MLflow: Log experiment metrics
    StepPod->>S3: Upload model artifacts
    StepPod-->>Argo: Step complete

    Argo->>StepPod: Schedule step 3: Deploy model
    StepPod->>K8sAPI: Create InferenceService
    Note over KServeCtrl: Reconcile as in Workflow 1
    StepPod-->>Argo: Step complete

    Argo-->>DSPOp: Workflow complete
    DSPOp-->>DataSci: Pipeline run succeeded

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 4: Distributed LLM Inference (llm-d)

    participant LlmdUser as User / API
    participant LlmdGW as inference-gateway
    participant LlmdEPP as llm-d-router EPP
    participant EnvoyProxy as Envoy Proxy
    participant Coordinator as llm-d Coordinator
    participant PDSidecar as PD-sidecar
    participant PrefillWorker as Prefill Worker
    participant DecodeServer as vLLM Decode Server

    LlmdUser->>LlmdGW: Inference request
    LlmdGW->>LlmdEPP: ext_proc callout (gRPC 9002)
    Note over LlmdEPP: Evaluate KV-cache locality,<br/>queue depth, model load
    LlmdEPP-->>LlmdGW: Selected target pod
    LlmdGW->>EnvoyProxy: Route to selected backend

    alt Disaggregated P/D mode
        EnvoyProxy->>Coordinator: Forward request
        Coordinator->>PDSidecar: Orchestrate E/P/D pipeline
        PDSidecar->>PrefillWorker: Fan out prefill
        Note over PrefillWorker: Compute KV-cache
        PrefillWorker-->>PDSidecar: KV-cache transfer descriptors
        Note over PDSidecar: NIXL RDMA GPU-to-GPU<br/>KV-cache transfer
        PDSidecar->>DecodeServer: Deliver KV-cache + request
        DecodeServer->>DecodeServer: Generate tokens
        DecodeServer-->>LlmdGW: Streamed response
    else Standard mode
        EnvoyProxy->>DecodeServer: Forward request
        DecodeServer->>DecodeServer: Prefill + decode
        DecodeServer-->>LlmdGW: Streamed response
    end

    LlmdGW-->>LlmdUser: Streamed token response
